B.buu=new A.aK([0,"FontWeight.w100",1,"FontWeight.w200",2,"FontWeight.w300",3,"FontWeight.w400",4,"FontWeight.w500",5,"FontWeight.w600",6,"FontWeight.w700",7,"FontWeight.w800",8,"FontWeight.w900"],t.TM)
B.ady=new A.aq("Pause what you're doing if you can. A flush passes; you only need to ride it out.",8)
B.ad4=new A.aq("Let your shoulders drop away from your ears. Unclench your jaw.",8)
B.acw=new A.aq("Rest one hand on your belly, just below your ribs.",6)
B.abP=new A.aq("Breathe in through your nose and feel your belly push gently into your hand. Your chest stays fairly still.",10)
B.adB=new A.aq("Breathe out slowly through soft lips, as if cooling a hot drink. Let the out-breath be longer than the in-breath.",10)
B.acn=new A.aq("Now the timer will pace you. Follow the circle: in for 4, out for 6.",6)
B.beV=s([B.ady,B.ad4,B.acw,B.abP,B.adB,B.acn],t.c9)
B.adM=new A.h5("A slow, calming breath for when a flush begins. The guide settles you in for about a minute, then the breathing timer paces each breath: in for 4, out for 6.","Nothing. You can do this sitting, standing or lying down.",B.beV,null,!0)
B.ac9=new A.aq("Sit with your feet flat on the floor and your back supported.",8)
B.abS=new A.aq("Rest your hands in your lap and let your shoulders soften.",6)
B.adH=new A.aq("Breathe out fully through your mouth, emptying your lungs.",8)
B.acJ=new A.aq("Picture a square. Each side is one count of 4: breathe in, hold, breathe out, hold.",10)
B.acb=new A.aq("If holding feels uncomfortable, shorten every side to 3. Never strain.",8)
B.adG=new A.aq("Now follow the timer around the box.",5)
B.b2s=s([B.ac9,B.abS,B.adH,B.acJ,B.acb,B.adG],t.c9)
B.adO=new A.h5("Four equal counts: in, hold, out, hold. The guide gets you comfortable, then the timer counts each side of the box with you.","A chair, or anywhere you can sit upright.",B.b2s,null,!0)
B.adf=new A.aq("Sit with your back straight, or lie on your back.",6)
B.ado=new A.aq("Rest the tip of your tongue on the ridge just behind your top front teeth. Keep it there the whole time.",10)
B.adg=new A.aq("Breathe out completely through your mouth, around your tongue, with a soft whoosh.",8)
B.abR=new A.aq("You'll breathe in quietly through your nose for 4, hold for 7, then whoosh out through your mouth for 8.",10)
B.acd=new A.aq("Feeling a little light-headed at first is common. If you do, stop and breathe normally.",8)
B.aby=new A.aq("Now let the timer count with you.",5)
B.bd0=s([B.adf,B.ado,B.adg,B.abR,B.acd,B.aby],t.c9)
B.adT=new A.h5("A long, slow out-breath to help you wind down, often used in bed before sleep. Four breaths is enough to start with.","Somewhere to sit or lie comfortably.",B.bd0,null,!0)
B.ad9=new A.aq("Stand or sit however you are. Let your face and shoulders relax.",6)
B.adh=new A.aq("Breathe in through your nose until your lungs feel nearly full.",8)
B.acH=new A.aq("Then take one more short sip of air in through your nose, on top.",8)
B.acv=new A.aq("Now breathe out slowly through your mouth, all the way, for longer than both in-breaths together.",10)
B.abH=new A.aq("That's one sigh. The timer will lead the next few.",5)
B.bez=s([B.ad9,B.adh,B.acH,B.acv,B.abH],t.c9)
B.adX=new A.h5("Two breaths in through the nose, then one long breath out. One to three of these can settle you in under a minute.","Nothing. It works anywhere.",B.bez,null,!0)
B.adv=new A.aq("Sit back or lie down. Rest a hand on your belly.",6)
B.acR=new A.aq("Let your breathing find its own rhythm for a few breaths.",12)
B.abW=new A.aq("Now begin to slow it down. Breathe in through your nose and feel your belly rise.",10)
B.adm=new A.aq("Breathe out gently, letting your belly fall.",8)
B.abU=new A.aq("The timer will count 5 in and 5 out. If 5 is too long, it's fine to do less; comfort comes first.",8)
B.b8C=s([B.adv,B.acR,B.abW,B.adm,B.abU],t.c9)
B.adK=new A.h5("About six slow breaths a minute: in for 5, out for 5. Smooth and even, never forced.","Somewhere to sit or lie comfortably.",B.b8C,null,!0)
B.ade=new A.aq("Lie on your back or sit comfortably. Let your arms rest by your sides. Close your eyes if you like.",20)
B.acG=new A.aq("Take three slow breaths. With each out-breath, let yourself sink a little more into the bed or chair.",30)
B.abI=new A.aq("Bring your attention to your toes. Notice warmth, coolness, tingling, or nothing at all. Nothing is fine too.",40)
B.acs=new A.aq("Move up to the soles of your feet, your heels and the tops of your feet.",30)
B.adJ=new A.aq("Now your ankles, your calves and your shins. If you find tightness, just notice it and breathe.",40)
B.abT=new A.aq("Your knees, and then your thighs. Feel their weight resting down.",40)
B.adD=new A.aq("Your hips and your lower back. Let them be heavy.",40)
B.acZ=new A.aq("Your belly. Feel it rise and fall gently with each breath.",40)
B.ac0=new A.aq("Your chest and your upper back. Notice your heartbeat if you can feel it.",40)
B.abN=new A.aq("Your shoulders. Let them drop a little further.",30)
B.acq=new A.aq("Down your arms to your elbows, wrists, hands and each finger.",40)
B.abX=new A.aq("Your neck and throat. Then your jaw: let your teeth part slightly.",30)
B.acW=new A.aq("Your face: cheeks, eyes, forehead. Smooth out any frown.",30)
B.acg=new A.aq("The top of your head. If your mind has wandered at any point, that's normal; simply come back.",30)
B.ach=new A.aq("Now feel your whole body at once, breathing, from your head to your toes.",40)
B.aON=s([B.ade,B.acG,B.abI,B.acs,B.adJ,B.abT,B.adD,B.acZ,B.ac0,B.abN,B.acq,B.abX,B.acW,B.acg,B.ach],t.c9)
B.adU=new A.h5("About 9 minutes of moving your attention slowly through your body, noticing what's there without trying to change it. Turn on Read aloud so you can close your eyes.","Somewhere to lie down, or a comfortable chair.",B.aON,"Take a deep breath, wiggle your fingers and toes, and open your eyes when you're ready.",!1)
B.adz=new A.aq("Plant your feet on the floor and take one slow breath.",10)
B.ace=new A.aq("Look around and find 5 things you can see. Name each one to yourself: a colour, a shape, something small you hadn't noticed.",35)
B.add=new A.aq("Now 4 things you can feel: your feet on the floor, your clothes, the chair, the air on your skin.",30)
B.adk=new A.aq("Now 3 things you can hear. Near sounds, then far ones.",30)
B.acK=new A.aq("2 things you can smell. If nothing comes, think of two smells you like.",25)
B.adr=new A.aq("1 thing you can taste, or simply notice the inside of your mouth.",20)
B.ad3=new A.aq("Finish with one slow, full breath.",12)
B.bh_=s([B.adz,B.ace,B.add,B.adk,B.acK,B.adr,B.ad3],t.c9)
B.ae0=new A.h5("A quick way back to the present when thoughts are racing. You'll use each of your senses in turn, counting down from 5. About 3 minutes.","Nothing. Eyes open, wherever you are.",B.bh_,"Notice how you feel now compared with when you started.",!1)
B.abB=new A.aq("Get comfortable and take two slow breaths.",15)
B.abG=new A.aq("Feet: curl your toes down and tense your feet. Hold... and let go. Feel them soften.",25)
B.acP=new A.aq("Calves: point your toes up towards your knees. Hold... and release.",25)
B.adj=new A.aq("Thighs: press your knees together and squeeze. Hold... and let go.",25)
B.adn=new A.aq("Bottom: squeeze your buttocks. Hold... and release.",25)
B.adi=new A.aq("Belly: pull your tummy in gently. Hold... and let it go.",25)
B.ac6=new A.aq("Hands: make tight fists. Hold... and open your hands slowly.",25)
B.adq=new A.aq("Arms: bend your elbows and tense your upper arms. Hold... and let them drop.",25)
B.ada=new A.aq("Shoulders: lift them up towards your ears. Hold... and let them fall.",25)
B.ad0=new A.aq("Face: scrunch up your eyes, nose and mouth. Hold... and let your whole face go smooth.",25)
B.acS=new A.aq("Now scan back down your body. If anywhere is still tight, tense and release it once more.",40)
B.ad2=new A.aq("Breathe slowly and let your whole body feel heavy and loose.",40)
B.aDi=s([B.abB,B.abG,B.acP,B.adj,B.adn,B.adi,B.ac6,B.adq,B.ada,B.ad0,B.acS,B.ad2],t.c9)
B.adY=new A.h5("Tense each muscle group gently for about 5 seconds, then let go and notice the difference. About 6 minutes. Tense, don't strain, and skip anywhere that hurts.","Somewhere to sit or lie comfortably.",B.aDi,"Lie or sit for a moment and enjoy how loose your body feels.",!1)
B.abx=new A.aq("Sit upright but not stiff, hands resting in your lap. Close your eyes, or let them rest on the floor ahead.",20)
B.acT=new A.aq("Notice the points where your body touches the chair and the floor.",20)
B.acm=new A.aq("Find your breath where it's easiest to feel: the air at your nose, your chest, or your belly.",30)
B.ac_=new A.aq("Don't change it. Just feel each breath arrive and leave.",45)
B.acB=new A.aq('If it helps, silently say "in" as you breathe in and "out" as you breathe out.',45)
B.act=new A.aq("When you notice you've been thinking, that's fine. Gently note \"thinking\" and come back to the breath.",60)
B.abM=new A.aq("Keep resting with the breath. Each time you come back is a small success.",60)
B.aco=new A.aq("Now let go of focusing on the breath. Sit for a moment and let everything be as it is.",20)
B.b31=s([B.abx,B.acT,B.acm,B.ac_,B.acB,B.act,B.abM,B.aco],t.c9)
B.adQ=new A.h5("Five minutes of resting your attention on your breathing. Your mind will wander; noticing and coming back is the whole practice, not a failure.","A quiet spot where you can sit upright.",B.b31,"Before you get up, notice how your body and mind feel right now.",!1)
B.acp=new A.aq("Lie on your back with a pillow under your knees and your arms a little away from your sides, palms up. Close your eyes.",30)
B.ac7=new A.aq("Let your body be completely still and supported. There's nothing to do now but rest and listen.",30)
B.adp=new A.aq('Choose a short, kind intention, such as "I am at ease" or "I rest deeply". Say it silently to yourself three times.',40)
B.abE=new A.aq("Move your attention around your body as each part is named: right hand thumb, fingers, palm, wrist, elbow, shoulder.",40)
B.acI=new A.aq("Right side, waist, hip, thigh, knee, shin, ankle, heel, sole, toes.",40)
B.ad_=new A.aq("Left hand thumb, fingers, palm, wrist, elbow, shoulder.",40)
B.acD=new A.aq("Left side, waist, hip, thigh, knee, shin, ankle, heel, sole, toes.",40)
B.adw=new A.aq("Back of the body, the back of the head, then the forehead, eyes, cheeks, lips and chin. The whole body together.",40)
B.ad1=new A.aq("Now notice your natural breath. Silently count each out-breath down from 20 to 1. If you lose count, start again from 20.",90)
B.acr=new A.aq("Feel your body becoming heavy, sinking into the bed. Heavy... heavy.",40)
B.adu=new A.aq("Now feel it becoming light, as if floating just above the bed. Light... light.",40)
B.aci=new A.aq("Rest in stillness, simply aware, with nothing to do.",90)
B.adc=new A.aq("Bring back your intention and repeat it silently three times.",30)
B.b5Y=s([B.acp,B.ac7,B.adp,B.abE,B.acI,B.ad_,B.acD,B.adw,B.ad1,B.acr,B.adu,B.aci,B.adc],t.c9)
B.adN=new A.h5("About 12 minutes of guided deep rest, lying down. Turn on Read aloud so you can keep your eyes closed. If you fall asleep, that's fine.","A bed or mat, a pillow under your knees, and a blanket so you stay warm.",B.b5Y,"Slowly deepen your breath. Move your fingers and toes, stretch if you like, roll onto your side, and sit up gently when you're ready.",!1)
B.acM=new A.aq("Get comfortable with your notebook or notes app open.",15)
B.abY=new A.aq("Think back over your day from the morning. Let moments come to mind without judging them.",40)
B.acj=new A.aq("Write down the first good thing. It can be tiny: a cup of tea, sunshine, a laugh.",45)
B.ad8=new A.aq("Next to it, write why it happened or why it mattered to you.",40)
B.adl=new A.aq("Now the second good thing, and why.",60)
B.ac5=new A.aq("And the third good thing, and why.",60)
B.acV=new A.aq("Read all three back slowly. Let yourself feel each one again for a moment.",30)
B.aTf=s([B.acM,B.abY,B.acj,B.ad8,B.adl,B.ac5,B.acV],t.c9)
B.adS=new A.h5("Write down three good things from today and why they happened. About 5 minutes, best done in the evening.","A notebook and pen, or the notes app on your phone.",B.aTf,"Read your three things once more. You can look back over them on a harder day.",!1)
B.abC=new A.aq("Stand still for a moment. Feel your feet on the ground and the weight of your body.",20)
B.acF=new A.aq("Start walking at an easy, natural pace.",30)
B.abL=new A.aq("Feel each step: the heel landing, rolling through the sole, pushing off with the toes.",90)
B.adt=new A.aq("Notice your breath and the gentle swing of your arms.",60)
B.abF=new A.aq("Now open up to sounds: birds, traffic, voices, wind. Let them come and go without naming them.",90)
B.adF=new A.aq("Now what you can see: colours, light and shadow, things moving.",90)
B.adA=new A.aq("Notice any smells, and the air on your face and hands.",60)
B.ads=new A.aq("If your mind wanders, come back to the feeling of your feet.",90)
B.acc=new A.aq("Begin to slow down a little, still feeling each step.",30)
B.b7x=s([B.abC,B.acF,B.abL,B.adt,B.abF,B.adF,B.adA,B.ads,B.acc],t.c9)
B.adP=new A.h5("About 10 minutes of walking with your attention on your senses. Keep your eyes open and stay aware of traffic and where you're going. Turn on Read aloud and keep the phone in your pocket.","Comfortable shoes and somewhere safe to walk.",B.b7x,"Come to a stop and stand still for a few breaths. Notice how your body feels after walking.",!1)
B.abz=new A.aq("Sit or stand tall and let your shoulders drop.",6)
B.acC=new A.aq("Curl the sides of your tongue up into a tube and let the tip poke out a little.",10)
B.ac3=new A.aq("Can't curl your tongue? Lots of people can't. Rest your teeth together, part your lips and breathe in through your teeth instead.",10)
B.abZ=new A.aq("Breathe in slowly through your tongue and feel the cool air on it.",8)
B.acO=new A.aq("Close your mouth and breathe out gently through your nose.",8)
B.ad6=new A.aq("Now follow the timer: in for 4, out for 6.",5)
B.bf_=s([B.abz,B.acC,B.ac3,B.abZ,B.acO,B.ad6],t.c9)
B.adW=new A.h5("A cooling breath: in over a curled tongue, out slowly through the nose. The guide shows you how, then the timer paces you: in for 4, out for 6.","Nothing. Sit or stand, wherever you are.",B.bf_,null,!0)
B.adx=new A.aq("Sit upright and rest your left hand in your lap.",6)
B.acu=new A.aq("Lift your right hand. Your thumb will close your right nostril and your ring finger your left. Rest your other fingers on your forehead or fold them in.",12)
B.abJ=new A.aq("Close your right nostril with your thumb. Breathe in slowly through the left.",8)
B.adb=new A.aq("Close the left with your ring finger, lift your thumb, and breathe out through the right.",8)
B.ac8=new A.aq("Breathe in through the right. Then swap and breathe out through the left. That's one round.",10)
B.aca=new A.aq("Remember: swap sides after every breath out. Now let the timer pace you.",6)
B.bfm=s([B.adx,B.acu,B.abJ,B.adb,B.ac8,B.aca],t.c9)
B.adV=new A.h5("Breathing through one nostril at a time, swapping after each breath out. The guide shows you the hand position, then the timer paces each breath at 4 in and 4 out.","A chair, and a clear nose.",B.bfm,null,!0)
B.ac2=new A.aq("Sit comfortably, close your eyes and take three slow breaths.",25)
B.ac1=new A.aq("Bring yourself to mind, as you are today. Silently say: may I be well. May I be at ease. May I be kind to myself.",60)
B.acf=new A.aq("Now picture someone you love. Wish them the same: may you be well. May you be at ease. May you be happy.",60)
B.acA=new A.aq("Now someone neutral, perhaps someone you passed today. May you be well. May you be at ease.",50)
B.acL=new A.aq("If it feels OK, someone you find difficult. Only as far as feels right: may you be well.",50)
B.acX=new A.aq("Now widen it out to everyone, everywhere, yourself included: may we all be well. May we all be at ease.",50)
B.ad7=new A.aq("Rest for a few breaths before you open your eyes.",25)
B.bjF=s([B.ac2,B.ac1,B.acf,B.acA,B.acL,B.acX,B.ad7],t.c9)
B.ae_=new A.h5("About 7 minutes of silently wishing yourself and others well. If it feels awkward at first, that's normal; just keep saying the words.","Somewhere quiet to sit.",B.bjF,"Notice any warmth or softness you feel, and carry a little of it into your day.",!1)
B.acY=new A.aq("Hold the food in your hand. Imagine you've never seen one before.",25)
B.acU=new A.aq("Look at it closely: the colour, the shine, the ridges and shadows.",30)
B.acz=new A.aq("Feel it between your fingers. Is it soft, firm, sticky, smooth?",25)
B.adE=new A.aq("Hold it under your nose and smell it. Notice if your mouth waters.",25)
B.abA=new A.aq("Place it on your tongue, but don't chew yet. Notice how it feels.",30)
B.acE=new A.aq("Now chew slowly, once or twice. Notice the taste spread and change.",40)
B.abK=new A.aq("When you're ready, swallow. Notice the after-taste and how your body feels.",30)
B.aP4=s([B.acY,B.acU,B.acz,B.adE,B.abA,B.acE,B.abK],t.c9)
B.adL=new A.h5("About 5 minutes eating one small food very slowly. It helps you notice taste and fullness at ordinary meals too.","One small food: a raisin, a square of chocolate, a grape or a slice of apple.",B.aP4,"Try taking the first bite of your next meal this way.",!1)
B.adI=new A.aq("Get comfortable, close your eyes and take a few slow breaths.",25)
B.abD=new A.aq("Picture a place where you feel calm and safe: a beach, a garden, a favourite room, anywhere.",35)
B.abV=new A.aq("Look around it. Notice the colours, the light, and what's near and far.",40)
B.adC=new A.aq("Listen. What can you hear there? Waves, birds, a fire crackling, quiet?",35)
B.ad5=new A.aq("Notice the smells, and the temperature: warm sun, a cool breeze.",35)
B.ac4=new A.aq("Feel how relaxed and safe your body is here. Let your shoulders and jaw soften.",45)
B.acx=new A.aq("Choose a word for this place. Saying it later can help bring the calm back.",30)
B.abO=new A.aq("Rest here a little longer.",40)
B.b9X=s([B.adI,B.abD,B.abV,B.adC,B.ad5,B.ac4,B.acx,B.abO],t.c9)
B.adR=new A.h5("About 6 minutes picturing a place where you feel calm and safe. It can be real, remembered or made up. Turn on Read aloud so you can close your eyes.","Somewhere comfortable to sit or lie.",B.b9X,"Say your word once more. Wiggle your fingers and toes, and open your eyes slowly.",!1)
B.acN=new A.aq("Think of something that's bothering you. Start with something small. Let yourself feel it a little.",35)
B.ack=new A.aq("Say to yourself: this is a moment of difficulty. This is hard. Or simply: ouch.",30)
B.acl=new A.aq("Now: difficult moments are part of life. Many women feel this too. I'm not alone.",30)
B.acQ=new A.aq("Put a hand on your heart, or wherever feels soothing. Feel its warmth.",25)
B.acy=new A.aq("Say: may I be kind to myself. Or ask yourself: what do I need to hear right now? Say that to yourself.",45)
B.abQ=new A.aq("Take a slow breath and let it go.",20)
B.b4G=s([B.acN,B.ack,B.acl,B.acQ,B.acy,B.abQ],t.c9)
B.adZ=new A.h5("Three short steps for a hard moment, about 4 minutes: notice it, remember you're not alone, and offer yourself some kindness.","Nothing. You can do this anywhere.",B.b4G,"Whatever you feel now is fine. You can come back to these three steps any time.",!1)
B.buv=new A.aK(["hotflush",B.adM,"box",B.adO,"478",B.adT,"sigh",B.adX,"paced",B.adK,"scan",B.adU,"grounding",B.ae0,"pmr",B.adY,"meditation",B.adQ,"nidra",B.adN,"gratitude",B.adS,"walk",B.adP,"cooling",B.adW,"alternate",B.adV,"kindness",B.ae_,"eating",B.adL,"safeplace",B.adR,"selfcompassion",B.adZ],A.ae("aK<B,h5>"))
